WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.629
Behind the Race door, Map Select now draws the whole unlock path.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.848
It reads Maps: each map opens the next. A new rider starts with two open, Prairie

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:18.330
Paceline and Old Town Criterium.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.700
The backend serves the seven maps from a catalogue file, in unlock order, and anyone

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.804
can read it before signing in.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:36.118
An open map links to Race Setup, with its photo, distance, climbing and rating, and

00:00:36.118 --> 00:00:39.270
its stars. A best time shows once it's ridden.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.191
The next unlock is ringed in gold, with its facts and its goal: finish top three

00:00:46.191 --> 00:00:48.510
against bots on Prairie Paceline.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.522
Every other locked map is greyed, with a lock, and names its one goal: a race, a

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:58.600
star count, or a rider level.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.994
Colour is never the only sign. A screen reader hears locked, or locked, your next

00:01:06.994 --> 00:01:07.731
unlock.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.042
Beside the path, stars on every map: finish, top three against the medium pack, and

00:01:17.042 --> 00:01:18.205
beat your best.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.580
Once read, the catalogue stays on the device. With none kept and no network, Map

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.437
Select says so, and Try again asks again.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.635
The same path, from a phone to a desktop, where the star rules sit beside it.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:47.984
What the tests prove: seven behaviour specs and the backend's catalogue tests, all

00:01:47.984 --> 00:01:51.005
green, and the first bundle still under budget.

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:58.164
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:58.509 --> 00:02:03.021
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:04.692
every hill and interval.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:10.215
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:10.215 --> 00:02:15.663
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:18.653
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:21.491
A custom workout lives under Profile.
